sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client (client.app)
  participant M as MON (AuthMonitor)
  participant O as OSD
  C->>M: CEPHX_GET_AUTH_SESSION_KEY: name + challenge answer with the shared key
  M-->>C: session key (encrypted with the client key) + auth ticket (encrypted with the MON key)
  C->>M: CEPHX_GET_PRINCIPAL_SESSION_KEY: request an osd service ticket
  M-->>C: service ticket (encrypted with the osd service rotating key) + service session key
  Note over M,O: the OSD fetches the rotating keys from the MON with CEPHX_GET_ROTATING_KEY
  C->>O: authorizer = ticket + nonce encrypted with the service session key
  O->>O: decrypt the ticket with the rotating key, check expiry and caps
  O-->>C: authorizer reply (mutual proof)
